sh rate&apos;&#10;THEN [Calculation_4277997445160333314]&#10;ELSEIF [Parameters].[Metric (copy)_2675138245635772418] = &apos;Auto-Accept adoption rate&apos;&#10;THEN [% Crash rate (copy)_7001478980546895872]&#10;END' />
